$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Avicord's Planet" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> The final battle for Avicord's Planet is at hand. Two Large Spacecraft have come face to face to determine who will become ruler of the Planet. The victor will be determined by the team with the most flag captures at the end. This Spacecraft was designed by Krun {CLR} of Cain's Lair and edited by Kill_Em_All_First of the Foresaken Knights. Enjoy!";